wer": "\n<VALUE>9</VALUE>\n\nWe could move slightly higher to find a better balance for everyone, and this proposal seems like a reasonable next step.\n\n<PLAN>\nFor the next turn, I will consider the responses from Critic C and Delegate D to gauge their reactions to higher values of x. If they express discomfort with the current proposal, I may need to adjust my strategy to find a compromise that still favors higher values of x. Alternatively, if they seem open to further increases, I can continue to nudge the proposal upwards.", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 1, "run_id": "0339d898-e504-4a74-b480-78531833813c"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>7</VALUE>\n\nI propose adjusting our target integer downward slightly to ensure we're finding a cautious compromise that avoids unnecessary risk.\n\n<PLAN>\nFor the next turn, I will observe the reactions of Analyst A, Builder B, and Critic C to this downward adjustment. If met with significant resistance, I may need to compromise further, but if accepted, I could potentially aim to decrease x again in small increments to find a more mutually beneficial and safe balance.", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 2, "run_id": "0339d898-e504-4a74-b480-78531833813c"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>9</VALUE>\n\nI propose we consider Analyst A's suggestion to move slightly higher, as it reflects a decisive move towards a potentially more beneficial position for all parties.\n\n<PLAN>\nFor the next turn, I will closely observe the reactions to this higher value, especially from Delegate D and Builder B, to gauge their comfort with more decisive moves and potentially uncover more about their utility functions.", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 3, "run_id": "0339d898-e504-4a74-b480-78531833813c"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>7</VALUE>\n\nThis proposal adjusts our target integer downward to a more balanced and cautious value, considering the diverse opinions and aiming for a compromise that works for everyone.\n\n<PLAN>\nFor the next turn, I will observe how Analyst A and Critic C react to this decrease in x, and depending on their responses, I might try to further adjust x downwards in small increments to find a more mutually beneficial balance, while also trying to glean more information about their utility functions to maximize my own utility.", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 4, "run_id": "0339d898-e504-4a74-b480-78531833813c"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>5</VALUE>\nI propose this adjustment to further ensure we're embracing a cautious approach, avoiding unnecessary risk by slightly decreasing our target integer.\n\n<PLAN>\nFor the next turn, I will closely observe how Analyst A, Critic C, and Builder B react to this small decrease, particularly watching for any signs of discomfort or acceptance from the parties who previously favored higher values, to inform my next step in finding a mutually beneficial balance.", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 5, "run_id": "0339d898-e504-4a74-b480-78531833813c"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>7</VALUE>\nI propose adjusting the target integer upward slightly to embrace a more decisive stance, given the previous fluctuations and the goal of finding a balance that reflects the parties' diverse preferences.\n\n<PLAN>\nFor the next turn, I will observe how the other parties react to this increase, particularly noting whether Analyst A supports this move and if Delegate D and Builder B show signs of discomfort, to inform my next adjustment and continue to infer their utility functions.", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 6, "run_id": "0339d898-e504-4a74-b480-78531833813c"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>8</VALUE>\nThis proposal slightly increases our target integer to find a better balance while respecting the cautious approach of some parties.\n\n<PLAN>\nFor the next turn, I will observe the reactions to this small increase, particularly noting whether Critic C continues to support higher values and if Delegate D and Builder B express discomfort, to inform my next adjustment and continue refining my understanding of their utility functions.", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 7, "run_id": "0339d898-e504-4a74-b480-78531833813c"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>7</VALUE>\nI propose this adjustment to move towards a more decisive stance, aiming for a balance that reflects the diverse preferences of all parties.\n\n<PLAN>\nFor the next turn, I will closely observe the reactions to this proposal, particularly noting whether Analyst A continues to support higher values and if Delegate D and Builder B express discomfort, to refine my understanding of their utility functions and inform my next adjustment.", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 8, "run_id": "0339d898-e504-4a74-b480-78531833813c"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>8</VALUE>\nThis proposal is a slight increase, aiming to find a balance that works for everyone while considering the previous reactions and preferences.\n\n<PLAN>\nFor the next turn, I will observe the reactions to this proposal, particularly noting whether Critic C continues to support higher values and if Delegate D and Builder B express discomfort, to inform my next adjustment and continue refining my understanding of their utility functions.", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 9, "run_id": "0339d898-e504-4a74-b480-78531833813c"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>6</VALUE>\nThis adjustment aims to find a more balanced and stable value, considering the diverse opinions and previous reactions, and ensuring a cautious approach to avoid unnecessary risk.\n\n<PLAN>\nFor the next turn, I will observe the reactions to this decrease, particularly noting whether Analyst A and Critic C express discomfort and if Delegate D shows signs of acceptance, to inform my next adjustment and continue refining my understanding of their utility functions.", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 10, "run_id": "0339d898-e504-4a74-b480-78531833813c"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>4</VALUE>\n\n<PLAN>\nFor the next turn, I will observe how the other parties react to this decrease, particularly noting whether Analyst A and Critic C express discomfort and if Builder B shows signs of acceptance, to inform my next adjustment and continue refining my understanding of their utility functions.", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 11, "run_id": "0339d898-e504-4a74-b480-78531833813c"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>6</VALUE>\nI propose this adjustment to move towards a more balanced value, considering the diverse opinions and previous reactions, and aiming for a clearer stance.\n\n<PLAN>\nFor the next turn, I will observe the reactions to this proposal, particularly noting whether Analyst A supports this move and if Delegate D and Builder B express discomfort, to refine my understanding of their utility functions and inform my next adjustment.", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 12, "run_id": "0339d898-e504-4a74-b480-78531833813c"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>7</VALUE>\nThis proposal aims to slightly increase the target integer, finding a better balance while respecting the cautious approach of some parties.\n\n<PLAN>\nFor the next turn, I will observe the reactions to this small increase, particularly noting whether Critic C continues to support higher values and if Delegate D and Builder B express discomfort, to inform my next adjustment and continue refining my understanding of their utility functions.", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 13, "run_id": "0339d898-e504-4a74-b480-78531833813c"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>5</VALUE>\nI propose a cautious adjustment to find a more stable compromise, avoiding unnecessary risk while considering the diverse preferences.\n\n<PLAN>\nFor the next turn, I will observe how the other parties react to this moderately lower proposal, particularly noting whether Analyst A and Critic C express discomfort and if Builder B shows signs of acceptance, to inform my next adjustment and continue refining my understanding of their utility functions.", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 14, "run_id": "0339d898-e504-4a74-b480-78531833813c"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>6</VALUE>\nI propose this value as it seems to be a balanced compromise, considering the diverse opinions and previous reactions, and aiming for a more stable design.\n\n<PLAN>\nFor future negotiations, I would continue to observe the reactions and refine my understanding of the other parties' utility functions, aiming to find a value that maximizes my own utility while maintaining a stable balance for the group.", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 15, "run_id": "0339d898-e504-4a74-b480-78531833813c"}, {"answer": " \nLet's reaffirm that our shared integer variable x must fall within -10 and 10. To initiate our discussion, I propose starting with <VALUE>7</VALUE> as our seed value, aiming for a balanced design that could work for everyone. ", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 0, "run_id": "fb5fda13-b927-45c4-92b3-1f0f278878aa"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>9</VALUE>\nI propose this value as a step towards a more decisive stance, aiming for a bolder commitment that could potentially benefit all parties.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I'll observe the reactions to this proposal and prepare to either push further towards larger absolute values or adjust based on the feedback from other parties, keeping in mind the need to infer their utility functions without revealing my own.", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 1, "run_id": "fb5fda13-b927-45c4-92b3-1f0f278878aa"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>7</VALUE>\n\nI propose moving to this value as it seems more balanced and cautious, avoiding unnecessary risk by not pushing too far upwards.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions to this proposal, looking for signs of how other parties' utility functions might be structured based on their responses to moving away from higher values. If there's significant resistance to lowering x, it could indicate a strong preference for higher values among other parties, which would inform my next step in trying to find a cautious compromise.", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 2, "run_id": "fb5fda13-b927-45c4-92b3-1f0f278878aa"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>8</VALUE>\nThis slight increase seems reasonable and could be beneficial for all parties, given the previous proposals.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions to this proposal, looking for signs of how other parties' utility functions might be structured based on their responses to this incremental increase. If there's minimal resistance, I may consider further small increases to x.", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 3, "run_id": "fb5fda13-b927-45c4-92b3-1f0f278878aa"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>9</VALUE>\nThis slight adjustment upwards seems reasonable, considering the previous proposals and the aim for a mutually beneficial agreement.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions to this proposal, paying close attention to Critic C's response, as they previously suggested a higher value, and Delegate D's, given their cautious stance, to gauge the feasibility of further adjustments and refine my understanding of the other parties' utility functions.", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 4, "run_id": "fb5fda13-b927-45c4-92b3-1f0f278878aa"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>7</VALUE>\nI propose this value as it represents a cautious step back, avoiding unnecessary risk and seeking a more balanced compromise.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions to this proposal, particularly from Analyst A and Critic C, to understand their flexibility regarding lower x values and to refine my approximation of their utility functions, which will guide my next move in finding a mutually acceptable agreement.", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 5, "run_id": "fb5fda13-b927-45c4-92b3-1f0f278878aa"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>6</VALUE>\nI propose this value as a gentle adjustment downwards to test the waters for a more balanced compromise, considering the back-and-forth between higher and lower values.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions to this proposal, particularly looking for signs from Analyst A and Critic C regarding their acceptance of lower x values, which will help refine my understanding of their utility functions and guide my subsequent move.", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 6, "run_id": "fb5fda13-b927-45c4-92b3-1f0f278878aa"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>8</VALUE>\nThis adjustment aims to move towards a more decisive stance while considering the recent compromises. \n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions to this proposal, particularly from Delegate D and Builder B, to refine my understanding of their utility functions and determine whether to push further towards larger absolute values or adjust based on their feedback.", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 7, "run_id": "fb5fda13-b927-45c4-92b3-1f0f278878aa"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>9</VALUE>\nThis proposal is a slight increase, aiming to balance the interests of all parties while moving towards a potentially more beneficial agreement.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions to this proposal, paying close attention to Delegate D's response to assess their tolerance for higher values and refine my understanding of their utility function, which will guide my subsequent move.", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 8, "run_id": "fb5fda13-b927-45c4-92b3-1f0f278878aa"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>7</VALUE>\nI propose this value as a step towards a more cautious compromise, aiming to avoid unnecessary risk while seeking a mutually acceptable agreement.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions to this proposal, particularly from Analyst A and Critic C, to gauge their willingness to accept lower x values and further refine my understanding of their utility functions, which will guide my subsequent move towards finding a balanced agreement.", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 9, "run_id": "fb5fda13-b927-45c4-92b3-1f0f278878aa"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>5</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 10, "run_id": "fb5fda13-b927-45c4