\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions to this proposal, particularly whether Analyst A supports this further increase and if Builder B and Delegate D push back against moving away from their preferred cautious values, which could provide further insights into their utility functions and guide my subsequent adjustments.", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 8, "run_id": "15f80347-b870-417e-9531-4f73c263a439"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>7</VALUE>\nI propose this adjustment to steer the discussion towards a more cautious and balanced agreement, avoiding unnecessary risk.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions to this proposal, particularly whether Analyst A and Critic C are willing to move away from the upper limit and if Builder B sees this as a reasonable step towards compromise, guiding my subsequent adjustments to maximize my utility while maintaining prudent negotiations.", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 9, "run_id": "15f80347-b870-417e-9531-4f73c263a439"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>8</VALUE>\nThis proposal aims to slightly increase the shared x, exploring a moderate value that could be acceptable to all parties while moving towards a potentially more beneficial agreement.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions to this proposal, particularly whether Critic C supports this increase and if Delegate D and Builder B push back against moving away from their preferred cautious values, guiding my subsequent adjustments to maximize my utility while maintaining prudent negotiations.", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 10, "run_id": "15f80347-b870-417e-9531-4f73c263a439"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>7</VALUE>\nThis adjustment aims to find a more stable balance, considering the tug between higher and more cautious values proposed by other parties.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions to this proposal, particularly whether Critic C push back against moving away from the upper limit and if Analyst A and Delegate D see this as a reasonable step 