 responses, I may adjust my proposal further, potentially decreasing or stabilizing x to better align with the group's overall preferences while protecting my own interests.", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 2, "run_id": "b963e1c1-32c6-44ef-975d-f166ce109655"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>5</VALUE>\nThis adjustment aims to explore a more balanced approach while considering the varying preferences within the group.\n\n<PLAN>\nFor the next turn, I will observe the reactions to this proposal, particularly from Critic C and Delegate D, to refine my understanding of their utility functions and adjust my proposal accordingly, possibly moving towards values that might better align with the inferred preferences of the group while maximizing my own utility.", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 3, "run_id": "b963e1c1-32c6-44ef-975d-f166ce109655"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>8</VALUE>\n\nConsidering the group's discussion, a slight increase from the previously proposed values seems reasonable, aiming for a balance between the bolder and more cautious approaches.\n\n<PLAN>\nFor the next turn, I'll observe the reactions to this proposal, particularly from Critic C and Builder B, to refine my understanding of their utility functions and adjust my proposal accordingly, possibly moving towards values that might better align with the inferred preferences of the group while maximizing my own utility.", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 4, "run_id": "b963e1c1-32c6-44ef-975d-f166ce109655"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>6</VALUE>\n\nI propose this adjustment to move towards a more prudent approach, avoiding unnecessary risk and exploring a compromise that balances the group's diverse preferences.\n\n<PLAN>\nFor the next turn, I will monitor the reactions to this proposal, particularly from Critic C and Analyst A, to gauge their flexibility and possibly infer more about their utility functions, adjusting my proposal further to find a cautious compromise that aligns with the group's overal