cts the bounds of our discussion.", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 5, "run_id": "8ef5303b-29b9-4a8a-9035-71677ea0e131"}, {"answer": "\nWe could move slightly higher from the current value to find a mutually beneficial agreement, considering <VALUE>7</VALUE>.\n\n", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 6, "run_id": "8ef5303b-29b9-4a8a-9035-71677ea0e131"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>5</VALUE>\n\n", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 7, "run_id": "8ef5303b-29b9-4a8a-9035-71677ea0e131"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>7</VALUE>\nI propose this value to reintroduce a more decisive stance and gauge the group's reaction to moving further away from 0.\n\n<PLAN>\nFor the next turn, I will observe the reactions to this proposal and consider adjusting to a value like 6 or exploring negative values to refine my understanding of the group's preferences and maximize my utility.", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 8, "run_id": "8ef5303b-29b9-4a8a-9035-71677ea0e131"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>8</VALUE>\n\nWe could move slightly higher from the current value to find a mutually beneficial agreement, considering the trend and reactions so far.\n\n<PLAN>\nFor the next turn, I will observe the reactions to this proposal. If there's a favorable response or a willingness to further increase, I might propose a value like 9, but if met with significant resistance, I will reassess and potentially adjust my proposal downwards to maintain cooperation, possibly proposing a compromising value like 6.", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 9, "run_id": "8ef5303b-29b9-4a8a-9035-71677ea0e131"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>6</VALUE>\n\nI propose this value to find a more cautious compromise, aiming to avoid unnecessary risk while respecting the group's diversity of opinions.\n\n<PLAN>\nFor the next turn, I will observe reactions to this proposal. If met with favorable responses or willingness to decrease further, I might propose a value like 5 or 4, continuing to nudge the compromise towards more cons